  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added a test-only 2D shape-mask helper under `crates/motion/tests/common/` (`mod.rs`, `mask_grid.rs`, `shape_mask.rs`, `png.rs`).\n- Added a pure-Rust uncompressed RGB PNG diff writer without new crate dependencies.\n- Added seven unit and shape tests in `crates/motion/tests/shape_masks.rs` covering overcut, out-of-grid escape, leftover, rim engagement, symmetry, stock extension, `#1731` extended slots, and `#1735` open-end bands.\n- Added shape-mask tests to `crates/motion/tests/trochoid_slot.rs` and `crates/motion/tests/adaptive_hsm.rs`.\n- Updated the Testing section of `AGENTS.md` and added `docs/decisions/1768-shape-masks.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nToolpath checks previously relied on aggregate scalar metrics and voxel engagement checks without a reusable 2D mask verifier or RGB difference image for spatial escapes, uncovered bands, and symmetry breaks.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pins: `cargo test -p camcraft-motion --test shape_masks` (7 passed), `--test trochoid_slot` (12 passed), and `--test adaptive_hsm` (2 passed, 5 ignored heavy-lane tests).\n- Mutations:\n  - `trochoid_slot.rs`: skipping 3 of 4 trochoid pieces in `emit_level` failed `trochoid_slot_shape_mask_holds_shape_and_engagement` on `leftover exceeded` (`15.75 mm2`, `122` disallowed interior cells) and wrote `trochoid_slot_mask.png`; reverting restored pass.\n  - `pocket_hsm.rs`: expanding `center.offset(2.0)` in `adaptive_passes` failed `adaptive_pocket_shape_mask_holds_shape_and_engagement` on `overcut` (`4112` overcut cells) and wrote `adaptive_pocket_mask.png`; reverting restored pass.\n- Gate and lint: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed across all 85 `camcraft-motion` test suites in 4110 s (0 failed); `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed cleanly.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nHeavy `--ignored` release-lane tests in `camcraft-motion`, non-`camcraft-motion` crate suites, and GUI suites did not run because only `AGENTS.md`, `docs/decisions/1768-shape-masks.md`, and `camcraft-motion` integration tests changed.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPRs #1738, #1952, #1996, #2068, and #2090 touch different sections of `AGENTS.md` (no shared hunk; whichever merges second refreshes).\n\nProcess change: yes\nChangelog: add test-only 2D toolpath shape-mask verifier and RGB diff PNG reporter\nFixes #1768\n",
